  <p id="c-suishu-003-shenwuhua-yang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">煬皇帝諱<persName id="c-suishu-003-shenwuhua-yang:p001:m0004" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA">廣</persName>，一名<persName id="c-suishu-003-shenwuhua-yang:p001:m0008" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA">英</persName>，小字<persName id="c-suishu-003-shenwuhua-yang:p001:m0012" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA">阿𡡉</persName>，高祖第二子也。</p>
  <p id="c-suishu-003-shenwuhua-yang:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">開皇元年，立為<persName id="c-suishu-003-shenwuhua-yang:p002:m0007" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA">晉王</persName></p>
</text>
